# Loading a game from the pause menu at 640x480 on Direct3D 9. The case saves
# in Jellyfish Fields first, into the empty scratch save folder, then takes
# the taxi to Downtown (all_warps: Down picks it on the pause page, A twice
# rides). From there Load Game, three down in the options, lists that one save;
# A asks to confirm, Up picks Yes, and the game comes back in Jellyfish Fields
# at the spawn point.
#
# The list and the question show the save's date and the disk's free space.

wait 2400
press b
wait 120
press start
wait 60
press x
wait 60
press down
wait 30
press down
wait 30
press a
wait 90
press a
wait 240
press b
wait 60
press start
wait 60
press down
wait 30
press a
wait 30
press a
wait 900
press b
wait 60
press start
wait 60
press x
wait 60
press down
wait 30
press down
wait 30
press down
wait 30
shot reg_load_options 0
press a
wait 90
shot reg_load_list 0
press a
wait 60
press up
wait 30
shot reg_load_confirm 0
press a
wait 1200
shot reg_load_loaded 0
